{
    "title": "Solitaire",
    "description": "Classic lasts forever! The nostalgic card game: Solitaire\r\n\r\nSolitaire - Classic Solitaire Card Games by LinkDesks is an addictive and challenging classic card game for card lovers! A brand new solitaire classic card game experience with the original solitaire card games!\r\n\r\nOne of our good memories: Classic Solitaire Games.\r\nWait no more! Have fun in the Classic Solitaire offline game! Relax your mind and train your brain for free! Awaken the memory of joy playing classic card games!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES\r\n\r\n\u2665 Classic solitaire game\r\n\u2665 100% free solitaire game\r\n\u2665 Customizable card themes\r\n\u2665 Customizable backgrounds\r\n\u2665 Fun daily challenges\r\n\u2665 Unlimited free undo\r\n\u2665 Unlimited free tips\r\n\u2665 Left-handed mode\r\n\u2665 Crisp and easy-to-read cards\r\n\u2665 Option of font size\r\n\u2665 1 card or 3 cards flip mode\r\n\u2665 Winnable or random mode\r\n\u2665 Beautiful graphic design\r\n\u2665 Playable offline games\r\n\u2665 No wifi no internet needed\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n\r\nTo win Solitaire you must move all the cards to the four goals. Each foundation can only hold one suit and you must put the cards sequencing from Ace to King: Ace, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, Jack, Queen and King. You have to complete all suits to win the game: clubs (\u2663), diamonds (\u2666), hearts (\u2665) and spades (\u2660).\r\n\r\nSolitaire is one of the most played and funniest free games for both kids and adults. \r\nDon't worry if you haven't played or have already forgotten how to play Solitaire. No problem! Solitaire is one of the simplest games to play, and most importantly, Solitaire never bores you. Follow our simple guide in game and you will know how to play perfectly!\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s the perfect time killing game for a short period of refreshing brain training on the bus, in the toilet or in the office. Easy to play retro card game for all ages. You\u2019ll enjoy this authentic and original Classic Solitaire game! Great card game to pass the time and relax, and for helping to keep your brain focused. Let's end the boredom with this fun game!\r\n\r\nDownload Right Now! One of the most classic, nostalgic and popular card games in the world. It is worth mentioning that our game can be played online and offline mode without internet without wifi. Classic Solitaire Card Game helps you to relax your mind, remove stress, train your brain and kill time.\r\n\r\nWe want to hear from you! Please contact us with any comments or questions at: classicsolitaire@linkdesks.com\r\n\r\nThis Solitaire card game only focuses on giving you a truly fun experience for free! Have fun and relax, you can play as many games as you want with incredibly addictive and simple controls!\r\n\r\nA big THANK YOU goes out to our Solitaire players!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Classic lasts forever! The nostalgic card game: Solitaire<br><br>Solitaire - Classic Solitaire Card Games by LinkDesks is an addictive and challenging classic card game for card lovers! A brand new solitaire classic card game experience with the original solitaire card games!<br><br>One of our good memories: Classic Solitaire Games.<br>Wait no more! Have fun in the Classic Solitaire offline game! Relax your mind and train your brain for free! Awaken the memory of joy playing classic card games!<br><br>GAME FEATURES<br><br>\u2665 Classic solitaire game<br>\u2665 100% free solitaire game<br>\u2665 Customizable card themes<br>\u2665 Customizable backgrounds<br>\u2665 Fun daily challenges<br>\u2665 Unlimited free undo<br>\u2665 Unlimited free tips<br>\u2665 Left-handed mode<br>\u2665 Crisp and easy-to-read cards<br>\u2665 Option of font size<br>\u2665 1 card or 3 cards flip mode<br>\u2665 Winnable or random mode<br>\u2665 Beautiful graphic design<br>\u2665 Playable offline games<br>\u2665 No wifi no internet needed<br><br>HOW TO PLAY?<br><br>To win Solitaire you must move all the cards to the four goals. Each foundation can only hold one suit and you must put the cards sequencing from Ace to King: Ace, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, Jack, Queen and King. You have to complete all suits to win the game: clubs (\u2663), diamonds (\u2666), hearts (\u2665) and spades (\u2660).<br><br>Solitaire is one of the most played and funniest free games for both kids and adults. <br>Don&#39;t worry if you haven&#39;t played or have already forgotten how to play Solitaire. No problem! Solitaire is one of the simplest games to play, and most importantly, Solitaire never bores you. Follow our simple guide in game and you will know how to play perfectly!<br><br>It\u2019s the perfect time killing game for a short period of refreshing brain training on the bus, in the toilet or in the office. Easy to play retro card game for all ages. You\u2019ll enjoy this authentic and original Classic Solitaire game! Great card game to pass the time and relax, and for helping to keep your brain focused. Let&#39;s end the boredom with this fun game!<br><br>Download Right Now! One of the most classic, nostalgic and popular card games in the world. It is worth mentioning that our game can be played online and offline mode without internet without wifi. Classic Solitaire Card Game helps you to relax your mind, remove stress, train your brain and kill time.<br><br>We want to hear from you! Please contact us with any comments or questions at: classicsolitaire@linkdesks.com<br><br>This Solitaire card game only focuses on giving you a truly fun experience for free! Have fun and relax, you can play as many games as you want with incredibly addictive and simple controls!<br><br>A big THANK YOU goes out to our Solitaire players!",
